                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I thought the game was utterly charming, nice art complemented with atmospheric music and fairly challenging puzzles. Although the game's mechanics start becoming repetitive after a time, they never lack challenge. The story could be clearer, however, being the goal of the game to be minimalist in the telling of the characters' tales, that could be understandable.\n\nI would recommend this game to anyone looking for a challenging game with an atmospheric setting.",
